{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":74,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1916486,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287908,"Name":"SMiles","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1476770134,"LastPoster":{"Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1916486,"PostDate":1476770134,"PostContent":"Hi! \u00a0 I am starting my DW research. Planning on November 2017. I have narrowed it down to RIU Pla...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.mazzantti@live.ca","IpAddress":"70.68.96.72","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1476769030,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SMiles","Id":287908,"Name":"SMiles","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.68.96.72","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80813,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"365579f989c07fa8b51ab6cb66f89533","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am starting my DW research. Planning on November 2017.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have narrowed it down to RIU Playacar and Barcelo Maya. I am leaning more towards RIU Playacar due to price. I also have a lot of family traveling from England. How do I ensure everyone gets the best price when my travel agency doesn&#039;t help with flights from England? Has anyone else had this issue?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I really want the Barcelo Maya, I have heard only great reviews, however the price is a bit high for my guests, and I do want people to actually come!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\nHas anyone had a good experience at RIU Playacar? It has been renovated since 2015 and the grounds\/rooms look great.\n\nI&#039;m looking for simple. I don&#039;t have a lot of specific ideas myself. I am good to use everything that comes with a package with a few add-ons. But I don&#039;t want to be ripped off by going only with what the resort has to offer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any help or experience would be great!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;\n-SMiles.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916486,"PostDate":1476770134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am starting my DW research. Planning on November 2017.<\/p>\n<p>I have narrowed it down to RIU Playacar and Barcelo Maya. I am leaning more towards RIU Playacar due to price. I also have a lot of family traveling from England. How do I ensure everyone gets the best price when my travel agency doesn't help with flights from England? Has anyone else had this issue?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I really want the Barcelo Maya, I have heard only great reviews, however the price is a bit high for my guests, and I do want people to actually come!<\/p>\n<p>\nHas anyone had a good experience at RIU Playacar? It has been renovated since 2015 and the grounds\/rooms look great.<br>\nI'm looking for simple. I don't have a lot of specific ideas myself. I am good to use everything that comes with a package with a few add-ons. But I don't want to be ripped off by going only with what the resort has to offer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any help or experience would be great!<\/p>\n<p>\n-SMiles.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarah.mazzantti@live.ca","IpAddress":"70.68.96.72","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1476769030,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SMiles","Id":287908,"Name":"SMiles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.214.181","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80813,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75fa9f89e5292e8a19e08e6c7c4c941e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola @[member=\"SMiles\"] !!! Welcome to the amazing bestdestiationwedding.com community and a huge congratulations on your upcoming wedding. November will be here before you know it.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;ve had the experience of working at both Barcelo and a couple of the Riu resorts a handful of times and our experiences have always been wonderful. We&#039;re actually photographing a wedding at Riu Yucatan today.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How many guests are you thinking will be joining you? The biggest difference we can think of between the two resorts is size (Barcelo is HUGE compared to the Riu resorts) and proximity to Playa del Carmen. Barcelo is about halfway between PDC and Tulum where as Riu is right in Playacar and you&#039;d be very close to town, shops, restaurants, nightlife, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m certain someone will have an answer for you regarding booking. In the meantime we&#039;ll leave you with a little inspiration.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916491,"PostDate":1476798985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287908\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287908-smiles\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SMiles<\/span><\/a> !!! Welcome to the amazing bestdestiationwedding.com community and a huge congratulations on your upcoming wedding. November will be here before you know it.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We've had the experience of working at both Barcelo and a couple of the Riu resorts a handful of times and our experiences have always been wonderful. We're actually photographing a wedding at Riu Yucatan today.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many guests are you thinking will be joining you? The biggest difference we can think of between the two resorts is size (Barcelo is HUGE compared to the Riu resorts) and proximity to Playa del Carmen. Barcelo is about halfway between PDC and Tulum where as Riu is right in Playacar and you'd be very close to town, shops, restaurants, nightlife, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm certain someone will have an answer for you regarding booking. In the meantime we'll leave you with a little inspiration.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1916491]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-48418400-1476795282.jpg\" title=\"Andrea_Michel_Teaser_15.jpg - Size: 84.27KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-48418400-1476795282.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Andrea_Michel_Teaser_15.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1916491]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-59801800-1476795298.jpg\" title=\"Annie_Phil_Teaser_17.jpg - Size: 76.59KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-59801800-1476795298.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Annie_Phil_Teaser_17.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1916491]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-46147700-1476795320.jpg\" title=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_16.jpg - Size: 120.25KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/monthly_10_2016\/post-287055-0-46147700-1476795320.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Maribel_Leo_Teaser_16.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Jasmin & Matt - Breathtaking Destination Wedding & Lifestyle Photography<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\"><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/07\/star.png\" alt=\"star.png\">\u00a0rating on <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/reviews'>Facebook<\/a> & <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21784-jasmin-matt-photography\/'>BestDestinationWedding.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Still not convinced? Read our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/info\/testimonials\/'>testimonials of appreciation from previous couples <3<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<a><span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\">+52-1-984-114-3386<\/span><\/a><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ask us how we can help you plan your perfect wedding day.<\/span><\/span>","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464799539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.0.110","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80813,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"80694f75ba7c2e41255186777b307bbb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community SMiles and Congrats on planning your destination wedding in our romantic Riviera Maya!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Both of the resorts you&#039;re considering provide an awesome backdrop for wedding photos as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured at each one.....enjoy!\n\nTaken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/29\/RIU-Palace-Mexico-Wedding-Playa-del-Carmen-Photographers-MTM-Photography&#039;&gt;Riu Playacar Wedding Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;And these from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace&#039;&gt;Barcelo Maya Wedding Album 1:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and this Brilliantly coloured &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/2\/1\/Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian&#039;&gt;Hindu &amp;amp; Iranian Wedding at the Barcelo Maya Palace:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the very best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916500,"PostDate":1476827718,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community SMiles and Congrats on planning your destination wedding in our romantic Riviera Maya!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Both of the resorts you're considering provide an awesome backdrop for wedding photos as you can see in these magical wedding moments that matter we've captured at each one.....enjoy!<br>\nTaken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/02\/29\/RIU-Palace-Mexico-Wedding-Playa-del-Carmen-Photographers-MTM-Photography' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riu Playacar Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_593cd9e71e2e47c49a4c955a3aafd6b2.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>And these from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/15\/Wedding-Bliss-at-the-Barcelo-Maya-Palace' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Barcelo Maya Wedding Album 1:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_f83fc0a2087f49f287ef9da5704b1405~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and this Brilliantly coloured <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/2\/1\/Barcelo-Maya-Palace-Wedding-Hindu-Iranian' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Hindu & Iranian Wedding at the Barcelo Maya Palace:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_e42446c6a9ab481bbbee7eaab8664b77.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the very best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.91.75","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80813,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"153f2d7b06e104043ddec52e308c4add","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"SMiles\"]!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have two pretty good options. RIU Playacar is awesome, just renovated, it gives you this luxury hotel, it\u00b4s so fun, excellent service, the food is delicious, the huge beach with this light blue water in the front, white sand surrounded by palm trees... just perfect for your BIG DAY.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Barcelo Maya, crystal clear water, awesome views. The Resort has a breath taking chappel surrounded by water fountains, perfect for your wedding ceremony.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If have any question, just let me know, we are here to help you on this journey.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me show you some of my photography job, if you want, you can take a look at my website or my Fan page on Facebook, you are going to find some really good inspiration for your coming event.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/weddings-wickys-beach-club-3.jpg\" alt=\"weddings-wickys-beach-club-3.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;At The Riu...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/01\/riu-palace-wedding-photography-011.jpg\" alt=\"riu-palace-wedding-photography-011.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916535,"PostDate":1477028537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287908\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287908-smiles\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">SMiles<\/span><\/a>!<\/p>\n<p>You have two pretty good options. RIU Playacar is awesome, just renovated, it gives you this luxury hotel, it\u00b4s so fun, excellent service, the food is delicious, the huge beach with this light blue water in the front, white sand surrounded by palm trees... just perfect for your BIG DAY.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Barcelo Maya, crystal clear water, awesome views. The Resort has a breath taking chappel surrounded by water fountains, perfect for your wedding ceremony.<\/p>\n<p>If have any question, just let me know, we are here to help you on this journey.<\/p>\n<p>Let me show you some of my photography job, if you want, you can take a look at my website or my Fan page on Facebook, you are going to find some really good inspiration for your coming event.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/08\/weddings-wickys-beach-club-3.jpg\" alt=\"weddings-wickys-beach-club-3.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>At The Riu...<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/01\/riu-palace-wedding-photography-011.jpg\" alt=\"riu-palace-wedding-photography-011.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<img src='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/BDW\/firma.jpg' alt='Posted Image' class='bbc_img' \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\nGonzalo Nunez - WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com'>www.gonzalonunez.com<\/a> - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/GonzaloNunezWeddingPhotographer'>Facebook Fanpage<\/a><br \/>\nCancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Mexico, rest of the world.","Email":"info@gonzalonunez.com","IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1282085479,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gonzaloNunez","Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80813","Title":"Riu Playacar Or Barcelo Maya Help!","LastPostDate":1477028537},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
